   · a team leader dialling under a CODE-shaped login is also classified as a leader — CB902TL reads "missing from the Agent List" — the code path needs S.tlCbs from the Worker’s /api/roster, which a file-only run has not got
   · a QA evaluation for an unknown agent appears in the exception register — QA codes with no roster row: ["CB095","CB999"] · M.unmatched has no QA source
